  "question": {
    "text": "Let the mirror image of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;respect to the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp; ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "137",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0cfcf03a-a1a1-43f0-9f8d-798d7e529e90-image.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p>Given the mirror image of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>The mid-point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;lies on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;is parallel to normal of the plane then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Now putting these values in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>170</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>137</mn></math></p>",
